{"id":"int-4264b5b2d42a9bab94c6d0b1850e7057","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-21T04:48:40.1330285Z","actor":"Thomas Lundquist","issue_id":"canvas-power-tools-y7x","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Doc 21 updated: Decisions 8-10 (no local change log, per-page revision restore with rename warning, editing-role presets) added; Decision 1 names the two copy sites; Module Context records Quiz Authoring staying in Assignments; V1 Scope no longer lists ChangeLog as a followed pattern; Open Question 3 marked answered (per page only, bulk revert = 0os), 1 and 2 cross-linked to 9lg and tnl."}}
