{"id":"int-014a670732d35c6ce18d6a304a70409c","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-21T22:45:00.0946671Z","actor":"Thomas Lundquist","issue_id":"canvas-power-tools-98y","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Theme value 'default' renamed to 'modern' across preferences.js, color.js, ui-injector.js, settings UI, theme-init.js, and docs 08/10. Back-compat: migrations.js v2 rewrites the stored preference; normalizePalette() + theme-init handle the localStorage copy the service worker cannot reach. lint/test(62)/build all pass."}}
{"id":"int-40f18a0807bd9b2dabc7d5e202c4fcbe","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-21T22:47:40.5299Z","actor":"Thomas Lundquist","issue_id":"canvas-power-tools-zmo","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Token guard hardened in eslint.config.js: added selectors for [#hex] arbitrary Tailwind values and bare hex literals (3/4/6/8-digit, so DOM ids/hrefs don't trip). Caught exactly 8 sites. Fixed the 3 real violations (FormControls, RadioGroup, AutoAssignModal — all #d1d5db -> var(--color-border)); the 5 content-script sites are outside our CSS cascade and now carry documented inline disables. The ~180 Rubric hexes and ScheduleCard StatusDot from the bead text were already re-tokened. bg-white/text-white left out on purpose and filed as c00 (needs a decision first). Rule documented in design_docs/10. lint clean, 62 tests pass, build OK."}}
{"id":"int-6d68ffaa6c0ae175dbab41e1b6f71532","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-21T23:11:32.8362494Z","actor":"Thomas Lundquist","issue_id":"canvas-power-tools-9lg","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Answered: NOT enabled. GET /api/v1/courses/:id/features/enabled returns 23 flags on this instance and scheduled_page_publication is absent, so wiki_page[publish_at] would be accepted and silently ignored. Doc 21 Decision 2 changed from 'pending an instance check' to out of scope, with the evidence, the caveat (course-scoped endpoint may not surface an account-only flag), and the empirical re-check recorded. Open Question 1 marked answered."}}
