{"id":"int-662519aaaf4bad3d9c2f9e6c87d2f5f6","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-21T23:17:48.7385968Z","actor":"Thomas Lundquist","issue_id":"canvas-power-tools-9lg","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Answered: NOT enabled, and NOT teacher-enableable. /features/enabled (23 flags) omits scheduled_page_publication; /features returns only 7 course-scoped flags for a teacher and does not include it either, so it is account-level and needs a Canvas admin. Doc 21 Decision 2 records the answer, that it is an admin action, the surprising-interaction cost if it is ever enabled, and the re-check endpoints. Open Question 1 closed."}}
{"id":"int-55941d9a667391d73f4c1b2c845da16a","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-21T23:19:21.0318743Z","actor":"Thomas Lundquist","issue_id":"canvas-power-tools-66u","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Fixed together: the action bars moved from position:fixed on the viewport to position:absolute inside the table column. 32f — deletes all three pieces of inset machinery (rightInset prop on both bars, PREVIEW_PANE_INSET export, --cpt-pane-inset token and the 64em media query that zeroed it); the column IS the space left of the preview pane, so centring is automatic in docked and overlay mode at every text size. Spacer rows kept (bar still overlays the last rows) and raised 14->17rem / 11->14rem after the user found the clearance tight. 66u — wrapper is pointer-events-none with pointer-events-auto on the card, so the invisible full-width strip no longer swallows clicks in the gutters; still needed since the card is narrower than the column. Overlay stacking re-checked: pane z-25 still paints over bar z-20, column sets position:relative with no z-index so creates no stacking context. Verified by the user in Chrome across both tools; lint clean, 62 tests pass, build OK."}}
{"id":"int-5504568738a4659fb606e3e55c963b1c","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-21T23:19:21.2360561Z","actor":"Thomas Lundquist","issue_id":"canvas-power-tools-32f","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Fixed together: the action bars moved from position:fixed on the viewport to position:absolute inside the table column. 32f — deletes all three pieces of inset machinery (rightInset prop on both bars, PREVIEW_PANE_INSET export, --cpt-pane-inset token and the 64em media query that zeroed it); the column IS the space left of the preview pane, so centring is automatic in docked and overlay mode at every text size. Spacer rows kept (bar still overlays the last rows) and raised 14->17rem / 11->14rem after the user found the clearance tight. 66u — wrapper is pointer-events-none with pointer-events-auto on the card, so the invisible full-width strip no longer swallows clicks in the gutters; still needed since the card is narrower than the column. Overlay stacking re-checked: pane z-25 still paints over bar z-20, column sets position:relative with no z-index so creates no stacking context. Verified by the user in Chrome across both tools; lint clean, 62 tests pass, build OK."}}
